    "storyHeadline": "Fun, refreshing and health-conscious!",
    "story": "In 2024, after moving to Cody, Megan put the idea of an Açaí Bowl Food Truck into action. Balancing a heavy workload—raising five children, relocating to a new state, continuing to work in Montana, and building a new business—she poured her time, energy, and creativity into launching Altitude Açaí. With hands-on support from her husband, they brought the food truck and now a Brick and Mortar to life, and began serving at local summer events and the Park County community all year long."
  },
